# cuts; not shipped publicly (we already have our own Brio recordings).
# Demo-day presentation binaries (kept locally, never in git — too large + binary)
# Dev-only — not for the public repo
# Internal screenshots and notes (replace older tracked files of same kind)
# Large CAD files (use Git LFS or share externally)
# LaTeX build artifacts (regenerated by latexmk)
